{"v":4,"catch":"你控制 Yuki 並擊敗對手的武術家！","desc":"\"TYPHOON GAL \"是由TAITO在1985年發布的一款動作遊戲。\n玩家控制武術挑戰者Yuki與敵對武術學校中最強悍的對手對峙。\nYuki可以使用主要和次要技術。\n用小技巧削弱敵人，然後用一個大技巧把他們打倒!\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-09-30","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1b6e9d4448e7853a31dd2949da74071818bfc2efdace5d9a7b0bcb0d7924e8eb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ed52dfa2a9bc1bf1eb2304cc9001168e2dbac4ccfa66f41ce54e2a2b96ad8826.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d29c3c487946c9e2e0518d361d943101427f7b38abffb254e41a82c40a046a5e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0adad4e29122ceca6b28f64dbca8142ed6de863d9d520c6e41c7420f7d2fb918.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f26df1823e0a9b9fadd636770c68129d56c300491f0dd2896bcda26708b766bc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2d0a8672145c9c29882a83a54130cca2d9053bd3fe654cf0b650951f1acefc9c.jpg"],"titleId":"01006b80156d2000","dlc":[]}